      "name": "Defender - Aggrevator",
      "type": "Sub-Roles",
      "description": "Whenever the active team member attacks with Basic Skill (any character so long as this character is off-field), additional damage will be done in a small AoE shockwave every 1.5 seconds, dealing damage equal to the amount of <b class=\"shield\">[Shield]</b> present on this character and can crit. The attack gains the element affinity of this character.",
