      "additional": [
        {"text": "Spokes above health bar records instances. When five instances of this damage occur, send 2 shockwave instances of <b class=\"knockback\">[Knockback]</b> and gain <b class=\"shield\">[Shield]</b> equal to 25% of own max health. After the instances, this character's Special Skills’ cooldowns are reset and trigger again automatically in succession (the character appearing briefly from off-field as an ally).",
